    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "As someone with an upper secondary education who prefers philosophy and computer science over physics, I view mathematics as a necessary tool rather than a passion. I find it logical and structured, useful for problem-solving, but I lack the enthusiasm my parents, who had higher education, often showed. It\u2019s a subject I respect for its utility but don\u2019t explore deeply on my own time.",
